{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1607760/extras/4417a4946051dfb50c9347db1f1769ba.poster.avif?t=1764609112\" width=780 height=439 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1607760/extras/4417a4946051dfb50c9347db1f1769ba.webm?t=1764609112\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Nether Spirits blends a rich, story-driven solo roguelike deckbuilder with seamless co-op and PvP battles\u2014forge your path, perfect your deck, and reclaim your soul alone or alongside others.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Solo, Co-op &amp; PvP</h2>Explore the Nether alone, join instant drop-in/drop-out co-op with anyone, or challenge others in 1v1 and 2v2 PvP\u2014whenever and wherever you want!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1607760/extras/13577c2b2b6ea00024145007895c9f8d.poster.avif?t=1764609112\" width=780 height=439 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1607760/extras/13577c2b2b6ea00024145007895c9f8d.webm?t=1764609112\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Combat With New Strategic Depths</h2>Plan your turn in advance with the Timeline system: queue and chain cards for game-breaking combos, unleash a flurry of attacks at once, or  tweak plays mid-turn before they resolve.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1607760/extras/183fa8623920b29e1b517cf7b792ad34.poster.avif?t=1764609112\" width=780 height=439 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1607760/extras/183fa8623920b29e1b517cf7b792ad34.webm?t=1764609112\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Uncover The Secrets of the Nether</h2>Travel the vast expanse of the Nether and discover its dark history. Explore age-old ruins in search of lore and treasure, meet compelling characters and help them on their way, or venture into hostile forests thick with fog and mystery - there is no wrong path, only your own.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1607760/extras/7a43e0ae67379516493fb46b8baa1223.poster.avif?t=1764609112\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1607760/extras/7a43e0ae67379516493fb46b8baa1223.webm?t=1764609112\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1607760/extras/7a43e0ae67379516493fb46b8baa1223.mp4?t=1764609112\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Interested? Join the Adventure NOW!</h2>Add Nether Spirits to your wishlist and join our Discord for the latest news and community chats!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1607760/extras/0891a401334c6f11ec7ac82fcf5787d6.poster.avif?t=1764609112\" width=780 height=439 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1607760/extras/0891a401334c6f11ec7ac82fcf5787d6.webm?t=1764609112\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><i>Note: All images shown are from a version still in development. The final product may differ from the materials presented here.</i>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1607760?t=1764609112","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.